{"overview":"جودی هیومن، سرسخت، سرکش و خسته از اینکه به‌عنوان باری محسوب شود، خشم خود را به یک انقلاب تبدیل می‌کند. در سال ۱۹۷۷، او به همراه بیش از صد نفر از فعالان حقوق افراد دارای معلولیت پیامی بسیار بلند می‌فرستند: سیستم خراب است—نه ما.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Scrappy, defiant, and done being treated like a burden, Judy Heumann turns her outrage into a revolution. In 1977, she and more than 100 disability rights protestors send a very loud message: The system is broken—not us.","tagline_en":"Based on a true revolution.","runtime":127,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["سیان هدر"],"crew_en":["Sian Heder"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Ruth Madeley","role":"Judith 'Judy' Heumann","photo":"/jSft5EhXFW04uOt2ysJId1SA3h6.jpg"},{"name":"مارک رافلو","role":"Joseph Califano","photo":"/5GilHMOt5PAQh6rlUKZzGmaKEI7.jpg","en":"Mark Ruffalo"},{"name":"دیلن اوبرایان","role":"Evan White","photo":"/xN3GdvIlqsR838gDoblhPH0numP.jpg","en":"Dylan O'Brien"},{"name":"Madeline Delp","role":"Kitty Cone","photo":""},{"name":"راب دلینی","role":"Congressman Miller","photo":"/xirfT1znRkkughLiPemKu3NhkKQ.jpg","en":"Rob Delaney"},{"name":"Ray Fisher","role":"Chuck Jackson","photo":"/310snvA05xDOQZDn2fJSp242GHw.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Patrick Thornton","role":"Ed Roberts","photo":"/t7Z7ubKXOi58K1Li4lcMJk0RkXN.jpg"},{"name":"Antwan Tolliver","role":"Brad Lomax","photo":""},{"name":"دنیل دورانت","role":"Steve McCleeland","photo":"/iG1GRiYy3JGlnoBKSnuNF6umtp6.jpg","en":"Daniel Durant"},{"name":"Jon Beavers","role":"Jim Pechin","photo":"/kUrejsnBmD5eUSm4ftapOiFUqML.jpg"},{"name":"Roberta Colindrez","role":"Joni Breves","photo":"/kDvrnApQrT73AzVaLDDOhCB0a0p.jpg"},{"name":"Siena Rafter","role":"Lynette","photo":""}],"trailer":"CQp2pUXLvJk","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1050981"}